  'method.lede':'We take what exercise science and Nordic nutrition have already proven, and dress it in the mindset that keeps you from missing a single day: the warrior preparing for winter.',
  'method.c1.t':'Explosive strength','method.c1.d':'Lifting heavy matters, but lifting fast changes the game. Intending to move the bar at maximum velocity recruits fast fibres, improves power and loads bone in a way slow tempo never does.',
  'method.c2.t':'Bones of steel','method.c2.d':'High loads, controlled impact and progressive jumping. Bone answers the demand you place on it — which is why this method targets bone density from week one, not as a side effect.',
  'method.c3.t':'Eat like the north','method.c3.d':'Oats, rye, barley, roots, fatty fish, berries and protein on every plate. Food that truly fills you, protects lean mass and leaves you without the mid-afternoon hunger.',
  'method.s.phase':'Phase 01','method.s.phase2':'Phase 02','method.s.phase3':'Phase 03','method.s.phase4':'Ongoing',
  'method.s1.short':'Technical base and initial assessment.','method.s2.short':'Load rises, ballistic work begins.',
