  'method.s1.t':'Forge — weeks 1 to 4','method.s1.d':'Assessment of strength, mobility and body composition. You learn the six fundamental patterns with moderate load and explosive intent. Your caloric baseline and protein floor are set.',
  'method.s2.t':'Anvil — weeks 5 to 9','method.s2.d':'Load rises and ballistic work appears: jumps, throws, pulls from the floor. This is where power is built and bone is stimulated. Food follows with more whole-grain carbohydrate on hard days.',
  'method.s3.t':'Raid — weeks 10 to 14','method.s3.d':'Intensity peaks, maximal strength sets and conditioning with sled, axe and kettlebell. Nutrition is steered toward your goal: recomposition, cutting or clean gaining.',
  'method.s4.t':'Clan council — ongoing','method.s4.d':'Fortnightly review of your app data, adjustment of loads and calories, and a video call with your coach. Nothing is left to chance or motivation.',

  'train.eyebrow':'Training','train.title':'The hall of iron',
