  'train.b1.t':'⚔ Heavy strength block','train.b1.d':'Squat, deadlift, press and row between 80 and 90 % of your max. Low reps, long rests, flawless technique. This is the foundation for everything else.',
  'train.b1.l1':'3–5 sets of 3–5 reps','train.b1.l2':'Load progression tracked week by week','train.b1.l3':'Technique video reviewed by your coach',
  'train.b2.t':'⚡ Ballistic block','train.b2.d':'Box jumps, cleans, medicine ball throws and kettlebell snatches. Moderate loads moved at maximum speed — this is where power is manufactured.',
