  'plans.p1.t':'Karl','plans.p1.s':'The self-reliant warrior. Your training and nutrition plan, ready to execute.',
  'plans.p1.l1':'Personalised strength + mobility programme','plans.p1.l2':'Paleo-protein nutrition plan with shopping list','plans.p1.l3':'Full access to the tracking app','plans.p1.l4':'Chat support',
  'plans.p2.t':'Berserker','plans.p2.s':'Pure explosiveness. Powerlifting and power with structure.',
